1221 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The Supply Chain Lead will be responsible for building\054 managing\054 and scaling the entire supply chain function at Naxatra Labs\054 including procurement\054 vendor development\054 stores\054 inventory planning\054 logistics\054 and import\055export operations\056\240This is a high\055ownership leadership role requiring strong technical understanding\054 system\055building capability\054 and the ability to ensure seamless material flow from vendors to production\056\240)
