1229 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Procurement \046 Vendor Management\240\nOwn end\055to\055end procurement strategy aligned with production and R\046D requirements\056\240\nLead sourcing of mechanical\054 electrical\054 and custom components including machined parts\054 castings\054 sheet metal\054 magnets\054 electronics\054 and assemblies\056\240\nDevelop and manage a strong vendor ecosystem across domestic and international suppliers\056\240\nDrive vendor negotiations including pricing\054 payment terms\054 credit cycles\054 and delivery commitments\056\240\nConduct vendor audits\054 capability assessments\054 and continuous development initiatives\056\240\n\nNew Product Development \050NPI\051 Support\240\nWork closely with R\046D during product development for sourcing feasibility and cost optimization\056\240\nEnsure timely availability of components for prototypes\054 pilot builds\054 and validation stages\056\240)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 1230 0 R
     /Pg 1179 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
